Today's Thoughts

Today was mostly about understanding the logic instead of coding. Tracing every comparison on paper helped me see how Bubble Sort works step by step. I also realized that if no swaps happen during a pass, the array is already sorted, so we can stop early instead of continuing all the remaining passes.
